	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Grounds: GND (standard symbol) = local / audio ground.  GND_USB = USB host-side ground (separate net when the isolator is fitted).\nRails 3V3_CLK and 3V3_ISO stay inside their sheets.  Only GND and GND_USB are global nets."
